        "hint": "The weekly export starts a read transaction on the same database and keeps it open while it streams. Nobody connects it to the load test. From now on, vacuum may not delete any row this transaction could still see.",
        "focus": [
          "report",
          "e-rep",
          "panel:xact_age",
          "panel:dead_tup"
        ],
        "notes": [
          {
            "panel": "xact_age",
            "text": "Open transaction ages steadily: it pins the cleanup horizon"
